  "non nate": "not born",
  "Lo swap automatico ha bisogno delle sue parole: dodici, nuove, solo sul VPS. Finché non nascono nessuno swap automatico parte.": "The automatic swap needs its words: twelve, new, only on the VPS. Until they are born no automatic swap starts.",
